---
<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">THE ARCHITECTURE</div>
    <h2>Four engines. <strong>One voice.</strong></h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Every morning brief, every decision assessment, every pattern insight is produced by a coordinated system — not a single AI guessing.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="engines">
    {engines.map((e) => (
      <div class="engine" style={`--accent:${e.color}`}>
        <div class="engine-num">{e.n}</div>
        <div class="engine-title">{e.title}</div>
        <div class="engine-body">{e.summary}</div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
  <div class="trust-strip">
    <div class="trust-eyebrow">THE ANTI-CHATGPT TRUST SIGNAL</div>
    <div class="trust-body">Every assessment ships with a <strong>calibration disclosure</strong> — the exact inputs the council was reasoning from. Operator record counts. Cohort archetype matched. Lanes that ran. Data thin? You see it. Data deep? You see that too. Most AI gives you confident output and asks you to trust it. SENTINEL shows you when to push back.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="engines-deep">
    <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:24px">DEEP DIVE — WHAT EACH ENGINE ACTUALLY DOES</div>
    <div class="engines-deep-grid">
      {deepDives.map((e) => (
        <div class="engine-deep" style={`--accent:${e.color}`}>
          <div class="engine-deep-head">
            <span class="engine-deep-num">{e.n}</span>
            <span class="engine-deep-title">{e.title}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="engine-deep-body" set:html={e.body} />
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
